      "content": [
        {
          "text": "From A to B and Intro to Okinawan Traditional Place Names",
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            },
            {
              "type": "underline"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "The structure to make this is:",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "〜から〜まり・までぃ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "沖縄（うちなー）から大和（やまとぅ）まり・までぃ = From Okinawa to (mainland) Japan.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "三時から五時まり・までぃ = From 3 o'clock to 5 o'clock",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "There are some traditional place names that were a must learn for Okinawan しまくとぅば9級:",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "石川（いしちゃー）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "糸満（いちまん・いちゅまん）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "浦添（うらしー）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "佐敷（さしち）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "首里（すい or しゅい the former is the reading in the past exam)",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "知念（ちにん）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "那覇（なーふぁ）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "西原（にしばる）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "南風原（ふぇーばる）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "与那原（ゆなばる）",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
